#: ../../source/6-synthetic_data/3-record_export.md:27
#: b1ac5791aebe4fe7ad7324cd6d243af1
msgid ""
"From the lerobot_ros2 README. **Python 3.12**, ROS 2 Jazzy, "
"[uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/) recommended."
msgstr ""
"摘自 lerobot_ros2 README。**Python 3.12**、ROS 2 Jazzy，推荐 "
"[uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/)。"

#: ../../source/6-synthetic_data/3-record_export.md:29
#: 361639af63c446668e8b85aa40814d4c
msgid ""
"git clone --recursive git@github.com:fiveages-sim/lerobot_ros2.git\n"
"cd lerobot_ros2\n"
"./init.sh all\n"
"# motion / task queue only:     ./init.sh all-motion\n"
"# recording plugins (if you skipped all):  ./init.sh install-lerobot\n"
"source .venv/bin/activate"
msgstr ""
"git clone --recursive git@github.com:fiveages-sim/lerobot_ros2.git\n"
"cd lerobot_ros2\n"
"./init.sh all\n"
"# motion / task queue only:     ./init.sh all-motion\n"
"# recording plugins (if you skipped all):  ./init.sh install-lerobot\n"
"source .venv/bin/activate"

#: ../../source/6-synthetic_data/3-record_export.md:38
#: d2c55e6f01a9461882fb4f61d67ab7a6
msgid ""
"`./init.sh all` = submodules + env + task orchestration + LeRobot plugins. "
"Bare `pip install -e .` at the repo root is not the install path."
msgstr ""
"`./init.sh all` = 子模块 + 环境 + 任务编排 + LeRobot 插件。仓库根目录裸 `pip install -e .` "
"不是安装路径。"

#: ../../source/6-synthetic_data/3-record_export.md:40
#: 7c1991978212438ea822d0bcdbdfd557
msgid ""
"Isaac example README also lists `./init.sh install-plugins` for this "
"checkout. Use the **lerobot_ros2** `./init.sh`, not a handwritten PyPI "
"`rclpy` install."
msgstr ""
"Isaac 示例 README 还写了本仓的 `./init.sh install-plugins`。用 **lerobot_ros2** 的 "
"`./init.sh`，不要手写从 PyPI 装 `rclpy`。"

